The '''Saleucami system''' was a [[star system]] in the [[galaxy]] that contained the [[planet]] [[Saleucami]]. It was located within the [[Suolriep sector]]<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" /> at the coordinates 08,05,29.<ref name="Grievous Intrigue">{{TCW|Grievous Intrigue}}</ref>

